- Routers: `app/api/v1/__init__.py:22-33` (`/products`, `/brands`, `/knowledge`, …)
- Public PDP API: `GET /api/v1/products/slug/{slug}` — `app/api/endpoints/products_catalog.py:278-280`
- Coverage gate: `fail_under = 68` — `pyproject.toml:23` (`CR-003`)

